From: Ramin Moussavi <lordrasmus@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] libgcc: soft-fp for bfin, csky, microblaze and sh on Linux

These targets computed in fp-bit, which rounds to nearest only and has
no notion of exception flags, so fenv cannot work there.  Build soft-fp
instead and include soft-fp-libc-fenv.h (from the patch before this one)
in their sfp-machine.h, the first one for bfin, csky and microblaze.

diff -Nru a/libgcc/config/bfin/sfp-machine.h b/libgcc/config/bfin/sfp-machine.h
--- a/libgcc/config/bfin/sfp-machine.h
+++ b/libgcc/config/bfin/sfp-machine.h
@@ -0,0 +1,84 @@
